WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.999
UBE Far Lateral Approach - L5-S1, Right

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:29.999
Far lateral entry, exposing the bony structures

3
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:47.999
Foraminotomy to decompress the compressed nerve root

4
00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:02.966
Dissecting the nerve root and widening the foramen

5
00:01:02.967 --> 00:01:17.933
Removal of the herniated disc (Discectomy)

6
00:01:17.934 --> 00:01:29.900
Final confirmation of nerve root decompression
